SPA login timeout (production hotfix 2026-10-14)

Live axios default is 30s. Under host swap, POST /api/auth/login can exceed that
and the login page looks broken even though the API later returns 200.

Apply in QuantDinger-Vue/src/utils/request.js request interceptor, next to the
existing AI/backtest timeout overrides:

    if (config.url.includes('/api/auth/login') || config.url.includes('/api/auth/login-code')) {
      config.timeout = ANALYSIS_TIMEOUT
    }

Live hashed bundle: ops/hotfixes/fe-compat/assets/index-KSaQnEjR.js
(already inode-patched on the production host).
